def summary = &apos;Read &apos; + vars.get(&apos;SCAN_33_2_PAGE&apos;) + &apos; page(s) of the filtered list; &apos; + wanted.count { it in found } + &apos; of &apos; + wanted.size() + &apos; BIN(s) created in this run are listed&apos;
